VideoKit v4.4.43 release trigger

Based on v4.4.42 stable branch behavior.
Fixes:
1. Natural numeric ordering for batch Reels audio/subtitle imports (1,2,...10 instead of 1,10,11,...2).
2. Allow dropping a single video/image directly into a specific row's background media cell.
3. Stabilize focus/typing in overlay template name dialog.

HDR -> SDR experiment is not part of this release.
